02:24:51.276 --> 02:24:52.516
What are you talking about?

02:25:03.804 --> 02:25:07.144
That's the other thing I meant to tell you out there.

02:25:07.144 --> 02:25:12.184
You see, Spencer's mummy and daddy come over here in 1956

02:25:12.184 --> 02:25:14.104
from the West Indies.

02:25:20.604 --> 02:25:23.544
Wolf Marling!

02:25:23.740 --> 02:25:25.740
Baby's brown!

02:25:28.188 --> 02:25:28.688
Juice?

02:25:34.350 --> 02:25:35.750
claiming to be Duke's father.

02:25:36.250 --> 02:25:38.710
He's a likeness, though.

02:25:45.310 --> 02:25:47.170
For God's sake, Marlene,

02:25:48.520 --> 02:25:50.740
I might be able to con people into buying my cars,

02:25:50.940 --> 02:25:52.340
I might be able to convince them

02:25:52.340 --> 02:25:54.660
that you conceived and gave birth in seven days flat,

02:25:54.780 --> 02:25:56.160
but how the hell am I going to persuade

02:25:56.160 --> 02:25:57.680
that my grandad was Louis Armstrong?

02:26:03.360 --> 02:26:12.220
I suppose he's right, eh Dil?

02:26:19.510 --> 02:26:21.820
You know it makes sense, eh?

02:26:23.920 --> 02:26:27.200
It's a nice little dream while it lasted, eh?

02:26:30.540 --> 02:26:31.040
Well-

02:26:31.276 --> 02:26:32.356
I'm going to turn around now.

02:26:33.516 --> 02:26:34.796
I'm going to walk out that door.

02:26:36.524 --> 02:26:37.644
And I ain't going to look back.

02:27:04.690 --> 02:27:12.070
Come on come on here your baby's hungry quiet quiet quiet your mum is coming

02:27:12.450 --> 02:27:16.030
Cheers yeah you got lovely bright eyes

02:27:16.030 --> 02:27:20.350
hey look at that she's going to be a blinder when she gets older

02:27:20.350 --> 02:27:21.630
isn't she?

02:27:22.010 --> 02:27:27.570
Coochie Coochie Coochie Coochie Coochie Coochie Coochie Coochie Coochie Coochie Coochie

02:27:56.170 --> 02:27:56.310
You

02:28:00.000 --> 02:28:01.540
Susanna Stroll
